        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodley_Park_(Washington%2C_D.C.)"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Rock Creek Park, Tregaron Conservancy, and Klingle Valley Trail give Woodley Park residents easy access to miles of natural trails.",
